 claim the  blade and face jang and the mages but  she is defeated and is taken hostage in  the milbon temple muruk secretly  retrieves the bride's pistol before she  is taken away  back in 2022 yeon runs away from home to  her friend  garda signs thunder to bring ian home  at home ye and demands her questions  about them be answered guard and thunder  then explained to her that they  imprisoned paro in humans minds with the  hopes that if the human dies the paro  dies too if aparra escapes their job is  to deal with it they never interfere in  human matters except for adopting yin  because if she is left behind she would  have died as a baby  moon doo sock acts weird during his work  becoming more violent  the paro prisoner inside him is taking  control and wants to break free a paro  ship arrives on earth on a mission to  release moon du sac from his paro  guard and thunder quickly leave to find  moon doo sock and intercept the paro  while yin insists to tag along with them  a chase ensues between moon doo sock the  paro and guard turns out the prisoner  inside moon doo sock is called  controller a powerful paro he can be  released if moon doo sock is stabbed by  the divine blade after successfully  completing his mission the paro  detonates himself fatally injuring guard  thunder rushes to give guard more life  support but guard decides to continue  chasing after controller they sneak into  controller's spaceship learning that he  plans to release java bubbles that  change the earth's atmosphere to be  suitable for them to exist without human  hosts but unhabitable for humans  their fight causes two hava bubbles to  break out so they try their best to keep  them from spreading  however a bubble already bursts and  causes many people to lose their breath  yin is fortunately saved by thunder who  sends guard's car to drive her home  the mysterious gun wielding bride turns  out to be grown up yin now trapped in  the past looking for controller  suitor and zhang the 