  controller with a pistol she hides in  her backpack  now that his host's body is badly  damaged controller needs to find a new  host to ensure his survival  meanwhile yin falls to the river along  with a blade  she swims to the surface and is found by  muruk who helps her search for the blade  mirror could not find it but he was able  to retrieve her backpack  the older muru can ye and then realize  that they have met before then regain  their consciousness and escape from  their coffins yin shoots her way out of  the coffin and searches the temple to  retrieve the blade while facing zhang  and suitor the mages help her to fight  against the paro using their antique  magical items  huxseal uses a magical magnifying mirror  to magnify her hands and yin's bullets  to effectively attack the paro  yeon runs with the blade with jang and  his paro chasing after her  she abandons her boat and quietly  crosses the river by swimming  meanwhile muruk successfully summons a  sword from his enchanted fan to fight  against the paro he kills suitor in his  paro which before he dies tells muruk  that he has something special within him  turns out that after little muruk helped  little yin out of the river they made a  fire and heard a strange sound  when muruk wandered to check the sound  controller still inside moon doo sock  appeared he transferred himself to  muric's body making him the new host  the mages realize that muruk is the  controller that the other paro have been  looking for and are questioning whether  they must kill him or not  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching

